# Paths here are relative to template/.
#
# The root .npmignore does not prune inside directories named in package.json's
# `files` allowlist, and `template` is one of them — so a root-only ignore list
# published 821 recording frames, the .work recon of a real product, and three
# licensed MP3s. This file is the one that actually governs what leaves here.

# Licensed music. The mechanism ships, the tracks never do — a stock licence
# covers using a track in a video, not handing the file to every installer.
# Music ships — the owner confirmed redistribution rights.

# Outputs of a run against someone's product, not part of the tool.
.work/
runs/
public/assets/*
!public/assets/.gitkeep
public/audio/*.wav
public/audio/audio.json
public/audio/vo/

# Render artefacts and build junk.
out/
output*.mp4
node_modules/
.env
.env.*
